id: pm-vcs-8bpi
title: Retire the vendored docstring analyzer and converge the changelog on replace mode
description: "pm-vcs carried a 529-line local fork of the docstring analyzer plus a 774-line test for it, while the fleet enforces the canonical analyzer published as pm-ops docstrings. The release workflow also still generated the changelog in prepend mode while the gate verified replace mode."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: changelog,ci,docstrings,gate
created_at: "2026-08-09T20:21:47.088Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-09T20:22:18.661Z"
deadline: "2026-08-10T00:00:00.000Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-09T20:22:18.647Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-09T20:22:18.647Z"
author: claude
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "The docstring gate is a thin launcher importing pm-ops docstrings under an exact pin, the gate still passes, coverage stays at 100 percent, and the release workflow generates the changelog in the same mode the gate verifies"
resolution: fixed
expected_result: "npm run docstring passes against the canonical analyzer, coverage stays at 100 percent, and npm run changelog:check exits 0"
actual_result: "The gate reports 32 files and 146 declarations documented, coverage is 100 across statements branches functions and lines, and the changelog check reports up to date"
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
  pm-vcs-pmc-s2bk,related,"2026-08-09T20:21:47.088Z",claude,"cli:create:dep",asserted
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T20:21:47.088Z",claude,"A one-file scan-count difference during verification turned out to be the temporary copy of the old gate left in scripts,not a narrowing of the canonical analyzer"
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T20:21:47.088Z",claude,1303 lines of vendored analyzer and its test removed in favour of a 146-line launcher and a 174-line launcher test
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T20:21:47.088Z",claude,"Before replacing a strict local gate with a shared one,compare the number of files each actually scans,because a shared gate that silently scans fewer files reports a green check that proves less than the fork it replaced"
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/release.yml,project,changelog generation switched to replace mode
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds}:
  npm run docstring,project,300
docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  scripts/docstring-gate.ts,project,thin launcher over the canonical analyzer
close_reason: Replaced the vendored analyzer with the canonical pm-ops launcher under an exact pin and converged the release changelog on replace mode
body: "The vendored fork and the canonical analyzer implement the same policy, but the canonical one is more thorough at 1273 lines against 529: both parse a real syntax tree, and both reject a docstring that merely restates its identifier via a novel-word floor after camelCase tokenization and filler stripping. Verified before swapping that the canonical analyzer scans the same 32 authored non-test files, so the gate did not narrow."
